{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226560","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226560","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1222656001:1":{"text":"你们不觉得那个人很可疑吗！你们动动脑子！","source_cn":"你们不觉得那个人很可疑吗！你们动动脑子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ACB98A7CEAF772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222656002:1":{"text":"我确实很想要赏金……但我没撒谎啊！我只是不确定她究竟是不是通缉令上的那个亡灵。","source_cn":"我确实很想要赏金……但我没撒谎啊！我只是不确定她究竟是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B08B12DCFF69066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222656003:1":{"text":"别慌张，红锚先生，我们相信你说的话，所以才想问问你和那位买家交谈的细节。","source_cn":"别慌张，红锚先生，我们相信你说的话，所以才想问问你和那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09306EE67C9FF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222656004:1":{"text":"我刚才不都说清楚了吗！你这耗子能不能听懂人话？","source_cn":"我刚才不都说清楚了吗！你这耗子能不能听懂人话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF288B672CA4E1E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222656005:1":{"text":"不得对梅林的使魔无礼！想拿走赏金，最好注意你的态度！","source_cn":"不得对梅林的使魔无礼！想拿走赏金，最好注意你的态度！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x292D9BAD943585DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不得对梅林的使魔无礼！想拿走赏金，最好注意你的态度！","female":"不得对梅林的使魔无礼！想拿走赏金，最好注意你的态度！","variant_male_record_index":